      "title": "v2.3 changes",
      "items": [
        "v2.3: Scenario test of the whole business block — 32 skills, 4 independent arms, a fictional paint workshop, no connectors. Numbers agreed across arms and with pre-computed answers: 42/43 truth checks, 5/6 guardrails, 7/8 cross-arm checks",
        "v2.3: Connector-free verdict — 15 skills pass, 17 partial, 0 fail; partials need web search, Canva, calendar, PDF or owner approval gates",
        "v2.3: One real finding — pay-the-bills proposed a payment run larger than available cash without defining which total is the run",
        "v2.2: Marketing, Sales, Finance and HR rebuilt from the Small Business pack in free / open-source mode"
      ]
    },
